          "type": "text",
          "text": "BC is parallel to DE, and triangles ABC and ADE are similar, with AB corresponding to AD and BC corresponding to DE. AB = (x + 2) cm, AD = (2x − 1) cm, BC = 12 cm and DE = 21 cm. Find x. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
